[00:21.58]1. Jehovah is faithful and fully aware
[00:28.10]Of all those who serve him whole-souled.
[00:34.04]He knows there are times their devotion and zeal
[00:40.10]Result in their loss as foretold.
[00:46.62]If you have left houses or fam’ly or friends,
[00:52.90]Be sure that our God knows the sum.
[00:58.36]He makes it up now with our dear brotherhood
[01:04.92]And life in the new world to come.
[01:11.10](Chorus)
[01:11.26]May Jehovah reward what you have done.
[01:17.76]May he provide a perfect wage for you.
[01:23.72]May you find refuge beneath his wings.
[01:29.36]Jehovah is faithful; Jehovah is true.
[02:10.34]2. At times we may feel that our lot in this life
[02:17.10]Has burdened us more than our share.
[02:23.28]And sometimes it seems that the cares of the day
[02:29.26]Are more than we’re able to bear.
[02:35.34]The God of all comfort takes note of your need;
[02:42.66]You know he’s the Hearer of prayer.
[02:48.14]His Word and his spirit and true, loving friends
[02:55.18]Will bring to you comfort and care.
[03:00.84](Chorus)
[03:01.18]May Jehovah reward what you have done.
[03:07.28]May he provide a perfect wage for you.
[03:14.40]May you find refuge beneath his wings.
[03:20.52]Jehovah is faithful; Jehovah is true.
